HB0185 Video recording of legislative meetings.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Lucas, Brady, Bratten, Brown, G,
Filer, Guggenmos, Heiner, Hoeft, Pendergraft, Strock
and Webber and Senator(s) Smith, D and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to the legislature; requiring the legislative service office to
live broadcast legislative meetings to the public as specified; and providing
for an effective date.
